<title>FRANCE: Bertrand Faure 97 H1 sales 8.01 bln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Bertrand Faure 97 H1 sales 8.01 bln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					8,008.5   vs   7,223.1</p>
<p>NOTE - Bertrand Faure, a supplier of car parts, said in a statement that first-half sales rose 12.1 percent on a like-for-like basis.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
